flowchart TD
    A[Approved Goal and Acceptance Criteria] --> B[Developer Agent]
    B --> C[Reviewer Agent]
    C --> D[Validator Agent]
    D --> E[Codex Evaluator Agent]
    E --> F{Evaluation Outcome}
    F -->|Satisfied| G[Human Approval]
    F -->|Partial| H[Lead Agent]
    F -->|Failed| H
    F -->|Inconclusive| I[Escalation]
    H --> B
